Local Storage is used to save data in the browser so it can remain after refreshing the page.
Local Storage stores values as strings

Why use JSON.stringify()?

To convert an array/object into a string so it can be stored in Local Storage.

Why use JSON.parse()?

To convert the stored JSON string back into a JavaScript array/object.

